      "type": "heading",
      "text": "· Rendez-vous ·",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The Rendez-vous bag takes a vintage saddle silhouette with a semicircular flap and leather strap, reimagined this season in soft, fluffy shearling that gives it a sculpted, dimensional shape. It features a nappa lambskin flap, a woven leather handle, and a detachable name tag, while metal studs trace a Western-inspired decorative motif across the flap, lending the bag a rebellious, untamed spirit. It comes in three colorways — honey/oak, ivory/talc, and mahogany/pomegranate — evoking snowy winter landscapes and forests.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
